"<p>Willkamen bi RSIBreak</p><p>In den Systeemafsnitt vun't Paneel is nu "
"RSIBreak to bekieken:</p>"

#. +> trunk
#: src/rsiwidget.cpp:124
msgid ""
"<p>When you right-click on that you will see a menu, from which you can go "
"to the configuration for example.</p><p>When you want to know when the next "
"break is, hover over the icon.</p><p>Use RSIBreak wisely.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Mit en Rechtsklick kannst Du en Menü opropen, över dat Du a.B. na de "
"Instellen kamen kannst.</p><p>Wenn Du weten wullt, wannehr de nakamen Paus "
"kummt, wies mit de Muus op't Lüttbild.</p><p>Bruuk RSIBreak klook.</p>"

